# default: ignore all files
*

# Allow README, LICENSE, CONTRIBUTING
!**/README*
!**/LICENSE*
!**/CONTRIBUTING*

# Allow .github directories
!.github/
!.github/**

# Allow other ignore
!*ignore

# Allow editorconfig
!**/.editorconfig

# Allow settings
!**/settings.json


## Root configs
!/package.json
!/pnpm-lock.yaml
!/renovate.json
!/lefthook.yml
!/dprint.jsonc
!/.shellspec
!/.mcp.json
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/Release-Note.md


## Project directories
!/scripts/
!/scripts/**
!/runners/
!/runners/**
!/configs/
!/configs/**
!/docs/
!/docs/**

# Website (allowlist details: aglabo.github.io/.gitignore)
!/aglabo.github.io/


## AI Agents
# claude code
!**/CLAUDE*.md
# allowlist details: .claude/.gitignore
!.claude/


##  Editor
#   VSCode
!.vscode/
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/*.code-snippets
!.vscode/cspell*
!.vscode/cspell*/**


##  Git
# allow all gitignore
!**/.gitignore
